WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:44.328
[Woozy Off-Kilter Synth Loop and Heavy Heartbeat Bassline Intro]

00:00:44.328 --> 00:00:49.152
The gauntlet's over

00:00:52.094 --> 00:00:56.458
But the fight's not done

00:00:59.841 --> 00:01:06.966
A new war has begun

00:01:08.107 --> 00:01:14.000
My skin is hot, my head is thick

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:19.400
This isn't panic, this is sick

00:01:22.841 --> 00:01:29.500
This is a bug she let right in

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:36.626
A battle I can't win

00:01:51.244 --> 00:01:56.486
99.8, a different kind of crash

