00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:39.893
A different kind of warmth and light

00:02:39.993 --> 00:02:45.056
And Aubrie's smiling, she's not mad

00:02:45.076 --> 00:02:48.500
My brain says good, but feels so bad

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:52.500
