00:02:56.500 --> 00:03:00.722
My legacy, my wiring: is this what love is?

00:03:04.524 --> 00:03:11.000
It's tiring... It's 99.8, a different kind of crash

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:21.755
The data's all colliding, my system's turning to ash

00:03:24.933 --> 00:03:32.000
It's not just hurt, it's not just fear, it's something I don't know

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:41.509
It's a positive overload that has nowhere to go

00:03:53.362 --> 00:04:00.000
System failing... Positive overload... 99.8...

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:26.680
[Soothing Synth Pad Fades Out]
